  "security_implications": "Touch to alerts/errors category. The alert_req_i connection tying all channels to alerts[0] can cause a single alert source to activate all alert outputs, undermining isolation and precise fault attribution. Combined with unconnected alert_ack_o and alert_state_o, the alert subsystem may not be able to clear or monitor the alerts correctly, potentially leaving the system in an unquiesced state. The forced fatal (`IsFatal=1`) without configurability could escalate recoverable faults to unrecoverable, affecting availability.",
